          ],
          "value": "Reversible hydration of carbon dioxide. Essential to photosynthetic carbon dioxide fixation, supplies CO(2) to RuBisCO (ribulose bisphosphate carboxylase, rbcL-rbcS) in the carboxysome (Probable). Loss of activity results in limitation of CO(2) availability to RuBisCO located in the cytoplasm (PubMed:24585024)"
